    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "tao",
      "text": "The Wall... a thousand years it stood. And a scout I caged showed you where to strike."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "Your gate is gone, Tao. Give me the shard."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "tao",
      "text": "Take it. It was never mine. The Crown only lent it to me, as it lends everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "tao",
      "text": "The Iron King waits for you in a tower wrapped in storm, where all the eras meet."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "tao",
      "text": "Every shard you carry pulls you closer to him. You think you hunt him, castle-breaker. He is reeling you in."
    },
    {
      "type": "wait",
      "duration": 1.2
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "He is gone."
