    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "roxana",
      "text": "Lay them together, General. See how the edges meet. A star, broken, and nearly whole again."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "roxana",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "bashir",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "bashir",
      "text": "Egypt, Rome, Persia, the Black Keep, and now the Wall. Only one link remains."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "bashir",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "liwei",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "liwei",
      "text": "A tower where all the eras meet. I have mapped every road in the east, and no road goes there."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "liwei",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "titus",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "titus",
      "text": "Then we make one. We have made roads through worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "titus",
