    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "The Iron King. So the Crown has a name at last, and a throne to break."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "We carry these shards to the edge of the world and end this. For Garin, and for all of them."
